WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:01.887
Tuesday night.

00:00:02.607 --> 00:00:04.967
Standing waves, one more time.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.900
Then three weeks go by.

00:00:08.567 --> 00:00:13.987
An exam question asks about resonance — and it's all a blur.

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:17.007
Keating 4.0 remembers.

00:00:17.627 --> 00:00:25.247
Before it replies, local recall finds the exact passage from her earlier work — and keeps a reference to where it came from.

00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:32.607
It runs on her own machine: a thirty-six megabyte model, switched on in Learning Settings.

00:00:33.447 --> 00:00:39.187
On a phone, search by meaning finds sessions by idea, not keyword.

00:00:39.867 --> 00:00:42.687
Your past work, working for you.
